# Browser
# "... or exiled card with flashback you own": on turn 1 Bot1's Tormod's Crypt exiles its own Firebolt, Lightning Bolt and
# the Crypt; on turn 2 Bot2's Crypt does the same to Bot2's Firebolt. On turn 3 Bot1's page aims Schemes at its own exiled
# Firebolt. Refused: the exiled Lightning Bolt (no flashback), the exiled Crypt, and Bot2's exiled Firebolt (not Bot1's).
# The Firebolt comes back to hand and the {R} Schemes adds casts it again, leaving nothing in the pool.
# Sorceress's Schemes {3}{R}: Sorcery
#   Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard or exiled card with flashback you own to your hand. Add {R}.
#   Flashback {4}{R}

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
